* ============================================================================
* sg13g2-comparator -- DERIVED NETLIST.  DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.
* ============================================================================
*
* Generated from the xschem sources in design/ by:
*
*     python3 design/netlist.py
*
* The schematics are the source of record:
*
*   design/comparator.sch              the design -- a single-tail StrongARM
*                                      dynamic latch (spec/decision-records/
*                                      0001-comparator-topology.md), plus the
*                                      isolation inverters and NOR SR latch
*                                      that make its outputs HELD between
*                                      strobes as the interface contract
*                                      requires
*   design/comparator_dut.sch          contract wrapper: tail-bias reference
*                                      on the `ibias` pin + the core
*   design/comparator_dut_latch.sch    contract wrapper: the core with its
*                                      tail-bias node tied to vdd
*   design/comparator_dut_analog.sch   the LOOP-BROKEN reduced sub-model --
*                                      an offset/noise LOWER BOUND, not the
*                                      design's front end.  Read
*                                      design/README.md before quoting any
*                                      number measured against it.
*
* Interface contract: sim/dut/README.md.  Asserted at generation time by
* design/netlist.py (against sim/harness/dut.py's own REQUIRED_SUBCKTS) and
* again at load time by the harness.
*
* Parameters supplied by the harness, not by this file: dut_ib, dut_vcm,
* vdd_val, vdd_nom, temp_c (sim/harness/runner.py compose_deck).  This file
* deliberately contains no .include / .lib / .temp / .control / .endc / .end.
* ============================================================================

.subckt comparator vinp vinn clk vbias dout doutb vdd vss
*.iopin vinp
*.iopin vinn
*.iopin clk
*.iopin vbias
*.iopin dout
*.iopin doutb
*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
XMT tmid vbias vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=40u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XMSW tail clk tmid vss sg13_lv_nmos w=40u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM1 np vinp tail vss sg13_lv_nmos w=12u l=0.34u ng=1 m=1
XM2 nn vinn tail vss sg13_lv_nmos w=12u l=0.34u ng=1 m=1
XM3 ln lp np vss sg13_lv_nmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM4 lp ln nn vss sg13_lv_nmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM5 ln lp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM6 lp ln vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM7 ln clk vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=6u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM8 lp clk vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=6u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM9 np clk vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XM10 nn clk vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMIAP lnb ln vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMIAN lnb ln vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMIBP lpb lp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=3u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMIBN lpb lp vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNAP1 na lnb vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNAP2 doutb dout na vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNAN1 doutb lnb vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNAN2 doutb dout vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNBP1 nb lpb vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNBP2 dout doutb nb vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNBN1 dout lpb vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNBN2 dout doutb vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=1.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
.ends

